<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MY PROFILE</view><view class="h1">我的信息</view><view class="muted">已使用当前微信账号自动登录，无需单独注册。预约前请填写昵称并授权微信手机号。</view><view class="form card"><view class="label">昵称</view><input value="{{name}}" maxlength="40" placeholder="请输入昵称" bindinput="name" /><view class="label">手机号</view><view class="phone-value">{{phoneVerified ? phone : '尚未授权'}}</view><view class="phone-hint">手机号由微信授权获取，不能手动修改；授权后会自动保存。</view><button class="phone-button" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="wechatPhone">{{phoneVerified ? '重新授权微信手机号' : '授权微信手机号'}}</button></view><button class="btn save-button" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存昵称</button></view>
